==Rolling Stock==
* [[Okami Metro 80 series|80 series]] (4-car sets):
*: The sole rolling stock for the Imaichi Line. These trains utilize linear induction motor (LIM) propulsion, drawing power from a 1,500 V DC overhead catenary. The 80 series is distinct from the 70 series used on the [[Nagata Line]] due to its more angular front profile and light brown color scheme. The interiors are designed with universal design principles, featuring lower handstraps and dedicated wheelchair spaces in every car.

